#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic Code Modifications {#automatic-code-modifications}"
msgstr "Modifikasi Kode Otomatis {#automatic-code-modifications}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"doQumentation automatically applies a small number of modifications to upstream\n"
"Qiskit tutorial and guide content to ensure a smooth, interactive experience.\n"
"This page documents every modification so you can understand exactly what\n"
"changed compared to the original IBM Quantum documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"doQumentation secara otomatis menerapkan sejumlah kecil modifikasi pada konten\n"
"tutorial dan panduan Qiskit dari upstream untuk memastikan pengalaman yang\n"
"lancar dan interaktif. Halaman ini mendokumentasikan setiap modifikasi sehingga\n"
"kamu bisa memahami dengan tepat apa yang berubah dibandingkan dokumentasi IBM\n"
"Quantum aslinya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notebook copies (Open in Colab / Binder / Code Engine) {#notebook-copies-open-in-colab-binder-code-engine}"
msgstr "Salinan notebook (Buka di Colab / Binder / Code Engine) {#notebook-copies-open-in-colab-binder-code-engine}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you click **Open in Colab**, **Open in JupyterLab**, or **Open in Code\n"
"Engine**, you receive a copy of the original notebook with these additions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat kamu mengklik **Open in Colab**, **Open in JupyterLab**, atau **Open in Code\n"
"Engine**, kamu akan menerima salinan notebook asli dengan tambahan berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup notice cell (markdown) {#1-setup-notice-cell-markdown}"
msgstr "1. Sel notifikasi setup (markdown) {#1-setup-notice-cell-markdown}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A blockquote cell is inserted at the very top explaining that doQumentation\n"
"added an automatic setup cell. It links back to this page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sel blockquote disisipkan di bagian paling atas yang menjelaskan bahwa\n"
"doQumentation menambahkan sel setup otomatis. Sel ini menautkan kembali ke\n"
"halaman ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Prerequisites cell (code) {#2-prerequisites-cell-code}"
msgstr "2. Sel prasyarat (kode) {#2-prerequisites-cell-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A code cell is inserted after the notice that:\n"
msgstr "Sel kode disisipkan setelah notifikasi yang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Installs required packages** (`qiskit`, `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`,\n"
"`pylatexenc`, plus any tutorial-specific packages detected via import\n"
"scanning). The install is **skipped** if packages are already present\n"
"(e.g. on Binder or Code Engine where they are pre-installed).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Menginstal paket yang diperlukan** (`qiskit`, `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`,\n"
"`pylatexenc`, ditambah paket khusus tutorial yang terdeteksi melalui pemindaian\n"
"import). Instalasi akan **dilewati** jika paket sudah tersedia\n"
"(misalnya di Binder atau Code Engine yang sudah terinstal sebelumnya).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Provides a commented-out credentials template** for IBM Quantum, so users\n"
"who want to run on real hardware can uncomment and fill in their API key.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Menyediakan template kredensial yang dikomentari** untuk IBM Quantum, sehingga\n"
"pengguna yang ingin menjalankan di hardware nyata bisa menghapus komentar dan\n"
"mengisi API key mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On Google Colab, this cell auto-runs on notebook open via the\n"
"`cell_execution_strategy: setup` metadata flag.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di Google Colab, sel ini dijalankan otomatis saat notebook dibuka melalui\n"
"flag metadata `cell_execution_strategy: setup`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Image path rewrites {#3-image-path-rewrites}"
msgstr "3. Penulisan ulang path gambar {#3-image-path-rewrites}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Relative image paths (`/docs/images/...`, `/learning/images/...`) are rewritten\n"
"to work correctly in standalone notebook environments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Path gambar relatif (`/docs/images/...`, `/learning/images/...`) ditulis ulang\n"
"agar berfungsi dengan benar di lingkungan notebook standalone.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "MDX pages (in-browser rendering) {#mdx-pages-in-browser-rendering}"
msgstr "Halaman MDX (rendering di browser) {#mdx-pages-in-browser-rendering}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The tutorials displayed on this website are converted from upstream `.ipynb`\n"
"notebooks or `.mdx` files. The following transforms are applied:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial yang ditampilkan di website ini dikonversi dari notebook `.ipynb` atau\n"
"file `.mdx` dari upstream. Transformasi berikut diterapkan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`pip install` lines** are added to Python code blocks that import\n"
"third-party packages, enabling one-click execution via thebelab.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Baris `pip install`** ditambahkan ke blok kode Python yang mengimpor\n"
"paket pihak ketiga, memungkinkan eksekusi satu klik melalui thebelab.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Tutorial Survey section**: A note is appended clarifying the survey\n"
"belongs to IBM Quantum and linking to doQumentation's GitHub Issues for\n"
"site-specific feedback.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Bagian IBM Tutorial Survey**: Catatan ditambahkan untuk menjelaskan bahwa\n"
"survei tersebut milik IBM Quantum dan menautkan ke GitHub Issues doQumentation\n"
"untuk umpan balik terkait situs.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Feedback widget**: A \"Was this helpful?\" widget is appended at the bottom\n"
"of each tutorial, tracked via privacy-friendly Umami analytics.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Widget umpan balik**: Widget \"Was this helpful?\" ditambahkan di bagian bawah\n"
"setiap tutorial, dilacak melalui analitik Umami yang ramah privasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**MDX syntax fixes**: Curly braces, heading hierarchy, and JSX compatibility\n"
"issues are automatically corrected for Docusaurus rendering.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan sintaks MDX**: Kurung kurawal, hierarki heading, dan masalah\n"
"kompatibilitas JSX diperbaiki secara otomatis untuk rendering Docusaurus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**OpenInLabBanner**: An interactive banner is injected below the title with\n"
"buttons to open the notebook in Colab, Binder, or Code Engine.\n"
msgstr ""
"**OpenInLabBanner**: Banner interaktif disisipkan di bawah judul dengan\n"
"tombol untuk membuka notebook di Colab, Binder, atau Code Engine.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is NOT modified {#what-is-not-modified}"
msgstr "Yang TIDAK dimodifikasi {#what-is-not-modified}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The **tutorial content itself** (explanations, code logic, outputs) is never\n"
"altered.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Konten tutorial itu sendiri** (penjelasan, logika kode, output) tidak pernah\n"
"diubah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Original author attribution** is preserved via frontmatter and the NOTICE\n"
"file (Apache 2.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0 licenses).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Atribusi penulis asli** dipertahankan melalui frontmatter dan file NOTICE\n"
"(lisensi Apache 2.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**No telemetry or tracking code** is injected into notebooks. Analytics\n"
"(Umami) only runs on the doQumentation website, not in exported notebooks.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada kode telemetri atau pelacakan** yang disisipkan ke dalam notebook.\n"
"Analitik (Umami) hanya berjalan di website doQumentation, tidak di notebook\n"
"yang diekspor.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source code {#source-code}"
msgstr "Kode sumber {#source-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All transformations are implemented in\n"
"[`scripts/sync-content.py`](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/blob/main/scripts/sync-content.py).\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua transformasi diimplementasikan di\n"
"[`scripts/sync-content.py`](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/blob/main/scripts/sync-content.py).\n"
